# A guard comparing a register written under a %tid.x guard: the tracer
# reads it as a constant (0 == 0), the uniformity analysis finds it
# divergent, so the store runs on a bound of the threads, not all 64,
# and stores at most 256 B per CTA.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/guarded_def.ptx | FileCheck "%s"
CHECK: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_guarded_def( // block 64×1×1 | per CTA: global store <= 256 B; param load 512 B{{$}}
CHECK: {{^}}	@%p2 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // <= warp * × lane * | exec <= 64/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req <= 5 (ideal <= 4){{$}}
